    "name": "NandroBolin vial. (Nandrolone Decanoate)",
    "description": "NandroBolin is an injectable steroid which contains 250 mg per ML of the hormone Nandrolone Decanoate.\nNandroBolin (Nandrolone Decanoate) makes hormone release from injection sight very slow. Bodybuilders often find that an injection schedule of twice per week is more than sufficient in keeping steady blood levels. NandroBolin (Nandrolone Decanoate) is a poor choice for tested athletes due to how long it lingers in the system. Those looking to use nandrolone and have it out of the system quicker will generally opt for a product like Durabolin. NandroBolin is one of the most popular steroids being used amongst bodybuilders today. NandroBolin is a low androgenic steroid with high anabolic effect. It will aromatize in high dosages, but not at the rate of testosterone. Progesterone buildup is one side effect that some have trouble with. Users sensitive to these issues might choose to add Cabaser or Dostinex to their cycle.\nNandroBolin (Nandrolone Decanoate) can be used for cutting or for bulking. Bodybuilders often stack NandroBolin with Testosterone for one of the most common and effective bulking cycles. The NandroBolin / Winstrol stack is also very popular. It is believed that Winstrol helps block the progesterone buildup while the NandroBolin heIps with the joint issues that some suffer while on Winstrol. The joint relief and healing that Deca provides is one of the main reasons it has become a very popular steroid with bodybuilders.\nAndrogen side effects are typically not an issue with NandroBolin (Nandrolone Decanoate) as long as doses are kept within reasonable range. Bodybuilders using NandroBolin (Nandrolone Decanoate) by itself sometimes report a loss of libido, therefore, it is recommended that one run at least a small dose of testosterone or even a high androgen like Proviron to help prevent this issue.\nWomen bodybuilders are also fond of NandroBolin (Nandrolone Decanoate), where it's mild androgenic nature makes it a safe steroid for them to use without fear of masculizing side effects.\nNandrolone Decanoate will shut down one's body's ability to make it's on natural testosterone, therefore a proper PCT program is recommended following a cycle of this substance. Male bodybuilders often use NandroBolin (Nandrolone Decanoate) in doses of 400-600 mg a week for 8-12 weeks, while women find a dosage range of 50-100 mg weekly to be sufficient for seeing desired results.",
